rm-itemWrapper\"><input type=\"email\" id=\"P41_EMAIL\" name=\"P41_EMAIL\" class=\"text_field apex-item-text\" value=\"mona.alharbi@\" size=\"30\" required></div><span id=\"P41_EMAIL_error_placeholder\" class=\"a-Form-error\"></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-12 apex-col-auto\"><div class=\"t-Form-fieldContainer apex-item-wrapper apex-item-wrapper--textarea\" id=\"P41_NOTES_CONTAINER\"><div class=\"t-Form-labelContainer\"><label for=\"P41_NOTES\" id=\"P41_NOTES_LABEL\" class=\"t-Form-label\">Delivery instructions</label></div><div class=\"t-Form-inputContainer\"><div class=\"t-Form-itemWrapper\"><textarea id=\"P41_NOTES\" name=\"P41_NOTES\" rows=\"3\" class=\"textarea apex-item-textarea\">Deliver to gate 4, Dammam 2nd Industrial City. Call the site supervisor 30 minutes before arrival; the site closes at 14:00 on Thursdays and the loading bay is shared with two other tenants.</textarea></div><span id=\"P41_NOTES_error_placeholder\" class=\"a-Form-error\"></span></div></div></div></div></div>",
